    "summary": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the PDB decoder that uses...",
    "details": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the PDB decoder that uses a stale pointer when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger this vulnerability by processing malicious PDB files to cause crashes or write a single zero byte to freed memory.",
